            "image": "shopify://shop_images/1201E8CB-A8BB-449C-8717-E3F0A3B6C76D.png",
            "eyebrow": "",
            "heading": "Why Was Soursop Erased From Cancer Medicine?",
            "body": "<p><strong>Why Was Soursop Erased From Cancer Medicine?</strong></p><p>For hundreds of years, families across the Caribbean used <strong>soursop leaves to treat illness.</strong> Generation after generation, cancer never touched their families.</p><p>But everything changed when cancer treatment became a billion-dollar business.</p><p><strong>Soursop was a threat.</strong></p><p>Why? Because a simple leaf could cost the drug industry billions if people chose it over expensive treatments.</p><p>So powerful drug companies buried research, silenced natural healers, and tried to erase soursop from medicine.</p><p><strong>They tried to bury the truth. But they couldn’t bury soursop’s story.</strong></p>",
            "background": "#fbfcf7",
            "accent": "#4f7847"
          }
        },
